w are you?", "Best wishes,"], "questions": [{"q": "Best wishes is a…", "a": "closing", "options": ["greeting", "closing", "question"]}, {"q": "Dear friend is a…", "a": "greeting", "options": ["body", "closing", "greeting"]}], "mission": "اكتب رسالة من 80 كلمة", "stage": "🚀 التعبير", "goal": "أستطيع التعبير عن فكرتي بطريقة واضحة", "resources": "https://learnenglishteens.britishcouncil.org/"}, {"id": 24, "level": "advanced", "title": "تحدي الإتقان", "kind": "مشروع ختامي", "focus": "read · write · listen · speak", "words": ["I can explain my ideas.", "I can ask questions.", "I can learn independently."], "questions": [{"q": "Which skill uses your voice?", "a": "speaking", "options": ["reading", "writing", "speaking"]}, {"q": "Which skill uses your ears?", "a": "listening", "options": ["listening", "writing", "reading"]}], "mission": "قدّم عرضًا قصيرًا وقارن تسجيلك الحالي بأول تسجيل", "stage": "🚀 التعبير", "goal": "أستطيع التعبير عن فكرتي بطريقة واضحة", "resources": "https://learnenglishteens.britishcouncil.org/"}]